OL,3,GNEWSAGST makes it right time to close,
OL,4,Asays jeweller
OL,5,
OL,6,FMachon's Jewellers is closing its doors
OL,7,Fafter 166 years with the incoming good
OL,8,Fand services tax (GST) among the
OL,9,Freasons given by its owner.
OL,11,FWill van Zanten said the closure of the
OL,12,Fstore at 47, The Pollet, St Peter Port,
OL,13,Fwas down to an accumulation of things,
OL,14,Fbut the impending introduction of the
OL,15,Fconsumption tax meant now was the right
OL,16,Ftime.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
