OL,3,GNEWSAGST makes it right time to close,
OL,4,Asays jeweller
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to introduce a 3% GST in
OL,7,F2029 was approved by Guernsey
OL,8,Fpoliticians earlier this month, which
OL,9,Fvan Zanten said would bring extra work
OL,10,Fand additional compliance expenses for
OL,11,Fsmaller local shops.
OL,13,F"Retail trade is changing," he said.
OL,14,F"I'm not so keen on the direction of
OL,15,Fchange."
